His/Her internal clients and main interfaces are the India Chairperson, the India Directors of each OPmobility Business Group as well as the various Managers and Team Members of the operational departments of the Business Groups (Sales, Purchasing, R&D, Warranty & Quality, Industrial, Safety, Human Resources)


