+ Assist the Regional And Local Functions in the drafting of their Specifications for all projects in India;






- Perform active contract management upstream by setting up the legal objectives and the contractual framework of OPmobility’s project at their start and actively ensure downstream the efficient and effective implementation of the contracts by the Operations;
